{"id":"doc:docs/knowledge-crib-storage.md#1-soulstore-source-of-truth","kind":"doc-section","file":"docs/knowledge-crib-storage.md","heading":"1. SoulStore (source of truth)","level":2,"anchor":"1-soulstore-source-of-truth","span":{"start":9,"end":30},"lang":"markdown","hash":"blake3:f4a9fd26f1c7f4b945413916902e89ac8e0d51a3dd7405bf8453ee6e9ec5f62c","meta":{"codeRefs":["ts\ninterface SoulStore {\n  load(): Manifest;                         // read .crib/crib.json\n  putNodes(ns: Node[]): void;               // upsert by id; routes to shard by source-path hash\n  putEdges(es: Edge[]): void;               // upsert by id; applies conflict rule on (src,dst,rel)\n  getNode(id: string): Node | undefined;\n  iterate(kind?: NodeKind): Iterable<Node>; // streaming, no full load\n  iterateEdges(rel?: Rel): Iterable<Edge>;\n  removeByFile(path: string): void;         // for incremental: drop a file's nodes + dangling edges\n  commit(): void;                           // flush dirty shard-chunks + rewrite manifest stats\n}","**Design:**\n- **Sharding:**","; chunk rolls at",". A\n  file edit touches one shard → small git diffs, low merge conflict.\n- **Encoding:** JSONL (one record/line) → streamable, line-diffable, append/patch-friendly.\n- **Upsert + conflict rule:** edges sharing","collapse per data-model §3 (EXTRACTED >\n  INFERRED > higher confidence; drop loser < threshold).\n- **Dirty tracking:** only touched chunks are rewritten on","interface","SoulStore","load","Manifest","//","read",".crib/crib.json","putNodes","ns","Node","void","upsert","by","id","routes","to","shard","source","path","hash","putEdges","es","Edge","applies","conflict","rule","on","src","dst","rel","getNode","string","undefined","iterate","kind","NodeKind","Iterable","streaming","no","full","iterateEdges","Rel","removeByFile","for","incremental","drop","file","nodes","dangling","edges","commit","flush","dirty","chunks","rewrite","manifest","stats"],"links":[]}}
{"id":"doc:docs/knowledge-crib-storage.md#2-indexstore-derived-fast-swappable","kind":"doc-section","file":"docs/knowledge-crib-storage.md","heading":"2. IndexStore (derived, fast, swappable)","level":2,"anchor":"2-indexstore-derived-fast-swappable","span":{"start":31,"end":52},"lang":"markdown","hash":"blake3:edd5a9267698e5461211060b88fed262fb7af9b6c52f9c4ee5fc5b31e9e0d499","meta":{"codeRefs":["ts\ninterface IndexStore {\n  buildFromSoul(soul: SoulStore): void;  // full rebuild; no options (no vector/ANN path ships)\n  applyDelta(changed: { nodes: Node[]; edges: Edge[]; removed: string[] }): void; // incremental\n  query(q: HybridQuery): Hit[];             // BM25 (no vector index wired; see","for the TF-IDF linker)\n  impact(id: string, dir: Dir, depth?: number): ImpactResult;  // reverse/forward edge traversal\n  neighbors(id: string, rel?: Rel, dir?: Dir): Edge[];\n  shortestPath(from: string, to: string, maxHops?: number): PathResult;\n  capabilities(): { cypher: boolean; vector: boolean };  // shipped: vector=false (hard-coded)\n}","**Backends behind one interface [C3]:**\n| Backend | Status | Notes |\n|---------|--------|-------|\n| **better-sqlite3 + FTS5** | **shipped (default)** | pure-Node, zero native-binding risk;",",","|\n| **LadybugDB** | planned / not-wired | native graph + Cypher + vector; richest; original planned default, never shipped |\n| **sqlite-vec (vector/ANN)** | planned / not-wired | optional vector layer on the sqlite backend; no","dependency shipped today |\n\nThe pipeline and MCP depend **only on","interface","IndexStore","buildFromSoul","soul","SoulStore","void","//","full","rebuild","no","options","vector/ANN","path","ships","applyDelta","changed","nodes","Node","edges","Edge","removed","string","incremental","query","HybridQuery","Hit","BM25","vector","index","wired","see","semantic","for","the","TF","IDF","linker","impact","id","dir","Dir","depth","number","ImpactResult","reverse/forward","edge","traversal","neighbors","rel","Rel","shortestPath","from","to","maxHops","PathResult","capabilities","cypher","boolean","shipped","false","hard","coded"],"links":[]}}
